*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : SLC1175-700
* Inductance = 70nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 100kHz-90MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor Frequency Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt SLC1175-700_freq port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=70pF Ind=0.07uH
X1 port1 port2 Model1A PARAMS:
+ R1=55
+ R2=0.000228
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00006
+ K2=0.011
+ K3= {Ind}
+ K4=-0.002
+ K5=0.000018
.ends SLC1175-700_freq

